   "end_sec": 22.956,
   "duration_sec": 3.682
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D006",
   "turn_index": 5,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "パクさんにも連絡しませんか。パクさんは今日は都合がいいですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D006-S01",
    "C17-D006-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 23.306,
   "end_sec": 27.817,
   "duration_sec": 4.511
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D007",
   "turn_index": 6,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "まだ連絡していません。今、メッセージを送ります。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D007-S01",
    "C17-D007-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 28.167,
   "end_sec": 30.944,
   "duration_sec": 2.777
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D008",
   "turn_index": 7,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "パク、今日、みどりセンターで一緒に勉強しませんか。二時からです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D008-S01",
    "C17-D008-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 31.294,
   "end_sec": 35.691,
   "duration_sec": 4.397
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D009",
   "turn_index": 8,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "ありがとう。午後はちょっと。今日は用事があるから、行かない。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D009-S01",
    "C17-D009-S02",
    "C17-D009-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
