   "end_sec": 43.491,
   "duration_sec": 2.891
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D011",
   "turn_index": 10,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "はい。来週はまだちょっと。後で連絡する。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D011-S01",
    "C17-D011-S02",
    "C17-D011-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 43.841,
   "end_sec": 47.361,
   "duration_sec": 3.52
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D012",
   "turn_index": 11,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "ありがとう。では、来週、もう一度メッセージを送る。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D012-S01",
    "C17-D012-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 47.711,
   "end_sec": 51.028,
   "duration_sec": 3.317
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D013",
   "turn_index": 12,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "リン、パクさんから返事が来ました。今日は用事があります。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D013-S01",
    "C17-D013-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 51.378,
   "end_sec": 55.156,
   "duration_sec": 3.778
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D014",
   "turn_index": 13,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "では、今日は二人ですね。私は一時半に準備を手伝いに行きます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D014-S01",
    "C17-D014-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 55.506,
   "end_sec": 60.779,
   "duration_sec": 5.273
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D015",
   "turn_index": 14,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "はい。勉強の後で、駅の前へパンを買いに行きませんか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D015-S01",
    "C17-D015-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 61.129,
   "end_sec": 65.459,
   "duration_sec": 4.33
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D016",
   "turn_index": 15,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "今日は買いに行きたくないです。家にパンがありますから。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D016-S01",
    "C17-D016-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 65.809,
   "end_sec": 69.864,
   "duration_sec": 4.055
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D017",
   "turn_index": 16,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "では、私は四時にパンを買いに行きます。一時半は受付の前ですね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D017-S01",
    "C17-D017-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 70.214,
   "end_sec": 76.073,
   "duration_sec": 5.859
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D018",
   "turn_index": 17,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "はい。一時半ですね。先にお昼ご飯を食べます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D018-S01",
    "C17-D018-S02",
    "C17-D018-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 76.423,
   "end_sec": 80.969,
   "duration_sec": 4.546
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D019",
   "turn_index": 18,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "中村さん、こんにちは。今、部屋に入ってもいいですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D019-S01",
    "C17-D019-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 81.869,
   "end_sec": 86.225,
   "duration_sec": 4.356
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D020",
   "turn_index": 19,
   "speaker": "中村",
   "source_text": "まだ入ってはいけません。今、入口で机を運んでいます。一時半から一緒に準備をしましょう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D020-S01",
    "C17-D020-S02",
    "C17-D020-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 86.575,
   "end_sec": 94.434,
   "duration_sec": 7.859
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D021",
   "turn_index": 20,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "ここは危険ですね。受付の前で待ちます。リンさんも一時半に来ます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D021-S01",
    "C17-D021-S02",
    "C17-D021-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 94.784,
   "end_sec": 99.869,
   "duration_sec": 5.085
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D022",
   "turn_index": 21,
   "speaker": "中村",
   "source_text": "はい。部屋の準備の前に、この注意を読んでください。部屋では水やお茶を飲んではいけません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D022-S01",
    "C17-D022-S02",
    "C17-D022-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 100.219,
   "end_sec": 108.022,
   "duration_sec": 7.803
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D023",
   "turn_index": 22,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "読みました。水は廊下で飲みます。この机は使ってもいいですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D023-S01",
    "C17-D023-S02",
    "C17-D023-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 108.372,
   "end_sec": 113.046,
   "duration_sec": 4.674
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D024",
   "turn_index": 23,
   "speaker": "中村",
   "source_text": "はい、使ってもいいです。一時半ですね。では、入ってください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D024-S01",
    "C17-D024-S02",
    "C17-D024-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 113.396,
   "end_sec": 118.345,
   "duration_sec": 4.949
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D025",
   "turn_index": 24,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "こんにちは。準備を手伝いに来ました。何をしましょうか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D025-S01",
    "C17-D025-S02",
    "C17-D025-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 118.695,
   "end_sec": 122.977,
   "duration_sec": 4.282
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D026",
   "turn_index": 25,
   "speaker": "中村",
   "source_text": "ありがとうございます。まず、二人でこの机を運んでください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D026-S01",
    "C17-D026-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 123.327,
   "end_sec": 127.655,
   "duration_sec": 4.328
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D027",
   "turn_index": 26,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "順番は、先に机ですね。その後で何をしますか。椅子ですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D027-S01",
    "C17-D027-S02",
    "C17-D027-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 128.005,
   "end_sec": 133.44,
   "duration_sec": 5.435
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D028",
   "turn_index": 27,
   "speaker": "中村",
   "source_text": "はい、椅子を運んでください。二時からここで勉強してもいいです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D028-S01",
    "C17-D028-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 133.79,
   "end_sec": 138.346,
   "duration_sec": 4.556
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D029",
   "turn_index": 28,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "はい。机を運んだ後で、椅子を運びます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D029-S01",
    "C17-D029-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 138.696,
   "end_sec": 142.284,
   "duration_sec": 3.588
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D030",
   "turn_index": 29,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "この机は大きいですね。一緒に運びましょう。椅子は入口にありますね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D030-S01",
    "C17-D030-S02",
    "C17-D030-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 142.634,
   "end_sec": 149.152,
   "duration_sec": 6.518
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D031",
   "turn_index": 30,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "はい。中村さん、入口の椅子はもう運びましたか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D031-S01",
    "C17-D031-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 149.502,
   "end_sec": 153.783,
   "duration_sec": 4.281
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D032",
   "turn_index": 31,
   "speaker": "中村",
   "source_text": "いいえ、まだです。入口の椅子を二つお願いします。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D032-S01",
    "C17-D032-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 154.133,
   "end_sec": 159.024,
   "duration_sec": 4.891
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D033",
   "turn_index": 32,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "はい。私はこの椅子を運びます。リンさん、もう一つの椅子をお願いします。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D033-S01",
    "C17-D033-S02",
    "C17-D033-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 159.374,
   "end_sec": 164.731,
   "duration_sec": 5.357
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D034",
   "turn_index": 33,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "準備はもう終わりました。二時ですね。部屋の入口はもう大丈夫ですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D034-S01",
    "C17-D034-S02",
    "C17-D034-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
