   "end_sec": 170.761,
   "duration_sec": 5.68
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D035",
   "turn_index": 34,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "はい、大丈夫です。勉強の前に、水を飲みたいです。先に廊下へ行きます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D035-S01",
    "C17-D035-S02",
    "C17-D035-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 171.111,
   "end_sec": 177.128,
   "duration_sec": 6.017
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D036",
   "turn_index": 35,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "私はここで待ちます。後でメッセージを一緒に読みましょう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D036-S01",
    "C17-D036-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 177.478,
   "end_sec": 181.684,
   "duration_sec": 4.206
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D037",
   "turn_index": 36,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "この二つですね。相手はリンさんと中村さんです。中村さんには丁寧なメッセージを送りました。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D037-S01",
    "C17-D037-S02",
    "C17-D037-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 182.034,
   "end_sec": 188.615,
   "duration_sec": 6.581
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C17-D038",
   "turn_index": 37,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "このメッセージは短いですね。中村さんにも準備と勉強の時間を書きましたか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C17-D038-S01",
    "C17-D038-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
